  "about": "[NOT WIRED YET \u2014 design \u00a7AE] Regional pyramid / monument styles for ruin_builder.gd. Ruins.pyramid_style() should pick a style whose spawn.realm contains the cell's realm (data/biomes realm field, \u00a7AA) AND whose spawn.biomes contains the biome key; no match \u2192 no pyramid. Biome keys are BiomeTemplates enum names (all exist).",
